266
00:22:57,088 --> 00:22:58,928
When when you get a funding, right?

267
00:22:59,088 --> 00:23:03,248
You as a startup, the first thing you want to do is spend that money on something good.

268
00:23:03,328 --> 00:23:05,408
And then talent is definitely one of them.

269
00:23:05,728 --> 00:23:15,808
But I think nowadays a lot of people now figure out so many things actually AI just can do for them, especially now there's like personal assistant come out that can do so many things.

270
00:23:15,982 --> 00:23:23,328
Unless it's something physical, you need someone to someone to have a you know workforce, like a real force, human force for it for you.

271
00:23:23,408 --> 00:23:26,528
Otherwise, there's a lot of things actually can be automated.

