00:23:50,446 --> 00:23:51,632
I think that's a great question.

277
00:23:52,014 --> 00:23:58,432
In terms of skill, I don't have any top of my head, but I can probably maybe explain this in the example.

278
00:23:58,672 --> 00:24:03,780
I feel maybe in the past, right, there's a lot of value in execution.

279
00:24:04,192 --> 00:24:04,432
Right.

