00:28:19,502 --> 00:28:30,912
And to most like now when I'm looking at our own company setup, I'm not really saying okay, we have to achieve software factory, like all of a sudden or by a certain date.

331
00:28:31,214 --> 00:28:37,572
What I'm tracking more is what is the month over month productivity growth per engineer.

